  ("Will I need surgery?","<p>Most disc problems settle with conservative care. Surgery is generally considered where there is progressive neurological loss, or where conservative care has been given a fair trial without improvement. Where the examination suggests a surgical opinion is needed, we refer.</p>",["nccih_back"]),
