 "Headache and dizziness",
 "Cervicogenic Headache and Dizziness｜Oakland Chinatown",
 "Assessment of headache and dizziness arising from the neck, in Oakland Chinatown. Examination separates neck-related causes from those needing referral.",
 "Some headaches and some dizziness originate in the cervical spine rather than in the head itself. Assessment identifies whether the pattern fits a cervicogenic cause, and equally importantly whether it does not — some presentations need medical rather than chiropractic assessment.",
