 "Therapeutic Massage｜Oakland Chinatown · Soft Tissue Work",
 "Therapeutic and meridian massage in Oakland Chinatown, used alongside chiropractic care for muscular tension and soft-tissue involvement.",
 "Therapeutic and meridian massage is used at the clinic for the muscular and soft-tissue component of musculoskeletal problems, generally alongside chiropractic care rather than as a standalone treatment. What is used follows from the assessment.",
